[CHANGE] benchmarks/runs/ring_buffer_qwen_moe_1/parts/ring_buffer/tests/ring_buffer_impl_test.py: Implemented comprehensive test suite for RingBuffer singleton. Tests cover: initialization (singleton registration), property contracts (capacity=10, size, is_empty, is_full), push postconditions (available capacity returns None, overwrite eviction returns evicted item, FIFO ordering), pop precondition (BufferEmptyError on empty), pop postcondition (returns oldest item, decrements size), clear postcondition (resets size to zero), and snapshot_items postconditions (FIFO order, non-mutating, empty list). Lifecycle pattern: setUp creates LifecycleRegistry and initializes it; each test uses enter_phase scope.
